<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Email Document</title>
    <style>
        /* Email container */
#email {
padding: 50px;
margin-top: 50px;
width: 500px;
border: 2px solid #000;
box-sizing: border-box;
font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
}

/* Confidential and Top Secret labels */
#confidential,
#top-secret {
display: inline-block;
padding: 10px;
margin-left: 10px;
border: 2px solid red;
font-weight: bold;
}

/* Individual rotations */
#confidential {
transform: rotate(-10deg);
}

#top-secret {
transform: rotate(10deg);
}

/* Blurred text */
.blurred {
filter: blur(3px);
}

    </style>
</head>
<body>

<main id="email">

```
<div id="confidential">CONFIDENTIAL</div>
<div id="top-secret">TOP SECRET</div>

<p>
    This email contains <span class="blurred">sensitive information</span> that should
    not be shared outside the organization.
</p>

<p>
    Please review the <span class="blurred">attached documents</span> carefully before
    proceeding with any decisions.
</p>

<p>
    Unauthorized disclosure of <span class="blurred">classified content</span> is
    strictly prohibited.
</p>
```

</main>

</body>
</html>
